/T (As of May 2025, 84,106 people had received the Opportunity Residence Right. Of these, 16,646 had successfully transitioned to a long-term residence permit \(~19%\), while 31,372 remained within the 18-month grant period \(~37%\) \(Mediendienst Integration, 2025\). )
